00:00:01,888 --> 00:00:09,791
On the left, plus two cubed cancels minus two cubed, three cubed cancels three cubed, and so on down the column.

3
00:00:09,791 --> 00:00:18,945
Like a telescope folding shut, everything collapses except the last and the first: n plus one, cubed, minus one.

